#: ../../examples/notebooks/07_symbolic_optics.ipynb:70004
msgid "The preset `presets/symbolic_focus.lumos` focuses a Nd:YAG beam (w₀ = 2 mm) with a lens of 500 mm and propagates it to its new waist. Each element applies its ABCD matrix to the complex parameter q, so the field stays a closed form; the power meter at the end needs numbers, and the journal records the conversion."
msgstr ""

