msgid "The new waist predicted by Gaussian optics (Self 1983) is $w_0' = \\frac{\\lambda f}{\\pi w_0} / \\sqrt{1 + (f/z_R)^2}$. The closed form carried by the field gives it directly:"
msgstr ""

